"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">07</div><h1>수와 시간</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Zahlen, Datum und Uhrzeit</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 07의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>A1 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">기수를 읽고 쓰고, 연도와 수량을 구별해 읽어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">서수로 날짜를 말해요 — der erste · am siebten</div><div class=\"x-goal\">공식 시각과 일상 시각(halb·Viertel·vor·nach)을 말해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">시간 전치사 um·am·im·in·seit·ab·von … bis를 골라요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> 26은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) sechszwanzig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) zweiundsechzig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) zwanzigsechs</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) sechsundzwanzig</button></div><div class=\"qe\">21 이상은 일의 자리(sechs) + und + 십의 자리(zwanzig)를 한 단어로 붙여요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;sechzehn&quot;],[&quot;siebzig&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Lara ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(16)</span> Jahre alt, Herr Graf ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(70)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">라라는 열여섯 살이고, 그라프 씨는 일흔 살이에요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Lara ist <b>sechzehn</b> Jahre alt, Herr Graf ist <b>siebzig</b>.</div>16과 70은 sechs의 s, sieben의 en이 빠져요 — sechzehn · siebzig.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> 83은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) dreiachtzig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) achtzigdrei</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) dreiundachtzig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) achtunddreißig</button></div><div class=\"qe\">일의 자리 drei를 먼저, und 뒤에 십의 자리 achtzig를 붙여요.<br>achtunddreißig는 38이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;zwanzig&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Das Brot kostet 3,20 €. → Das Brot kostet drei Euro <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">빵은 3유로 20센트예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das Brot kostet 3,20 €. → Das Brot kostet drei Euro <b>zwanzig</b>.</div>가격은 쉼표 앞을 Euro, 쉼표 뒤를 숫자로 읽어요 — drei Euro zwanzig.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> 'Es ist halb sieben.'은 몇 시?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) 7:30</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) 6:30</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) 6:07</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) 7:06</button></div><div class=\"qe\">halb 뒤에는 다음 시각이 와요. halb sieben은 7시를 향해 절반, 곧 6시 30분이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;um&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Die Fähre fährt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> 14 Uhr.</div><div class=\"qko\">페리는 14시에 출발해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Fähre fährt <b>um</b> 14 Uhr.</div>시각 앞에는 um을 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Am Samstag grillen wir im Garten.&quot;,&quot;Wir grillen am Samstag im Garten.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">토요일에 우리는 정원에서 바비큐를 해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">im</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">grillen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Samstag</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Am</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Garten.</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">wir</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Am Samstag grillen wir im Garten.</b></div>요일 앞에는 am을 써요.<br>Am Samstag이 첫 자리면 동사 grillen 뒤에 주어 wir가 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;im&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Ich habe <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> August Urlaub.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 8월에 휴가가 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich habe <b>im</b> August Urlaub.</div>달 이름 앞에는 im을 써요 — im August.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;erste&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Heute ist der <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(1.)</span> Juni.</div><div class=\"qko\">오늘은 6월 1일이에요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Heute ist der <b>erste</b> Juni.</div>1.은 불규칙 서수 erste예요. der 뒤라서 끝이 -e예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;siebten&quot;,&quot;siebenten&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Am <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(7.)</span> Oktober habe ich frei.</div><div class=\"qko\">10월 7일에 나는 쉬어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Am <b>siebten</b> Oktober habe ich frei.</div>7.은 siebte로 en이 빠져요. am 뒤의 서수는 -en이라서 am siebten이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> 'Viertel nach elf'는 몇 시?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) 11:45</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) 11:15</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) 10:45</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) 10:15</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Viertel nach elf는 11시에서 15분이 지난 시각이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;seit&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Tim spielt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> vier Jahren Gitarre.</div><div class=\"qko\">팀은 4년째 기타를 쳐요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Tim spielt <b>seit</b> vier Jahren Gitarre.</div>과거에 시작해서 지금도 계속되는 일은 seit + 현재형으로 말해요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> 1.000.000은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) ein Millionen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) zehntausend</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) eine Million</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) tausendtausend</button></div><div class=\"qe\">백만은 eine Million이에요. 2백만부터 복수 Millionen을 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Um wie viel Uhr öffnet die Bäckerei?&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">빵집은 몇 시에 문을 열어요?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">öffnet</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Bäckerei?</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">viel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Um</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">wie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Uhr</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Um wie viel Uhr öffnet die Bäckerei?</b></div>Um wie viel Uhr가 한 덩어리 의문사예요. 그 바로 뒤에 동사 öffnet, 다음에 주어가 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;neunundneunzig&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> Die Tomaten kosten <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:16ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(0,99 €)</span> Cent.</div><div class=\"qko\">토마토는 99센트예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Tomaten kosten <b>neunundneunzig</b> Cent.</div>1유로가 안 되는 값은 Cent로 읽어요 — neunundneunzig Cent.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> Der Film dauert <span class=\"qblank\"></span>. (두 시간)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) zwei Stunden</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) zwei Uhren</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) zwei Stunde</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) zwei Uhr</button></div><div class=\"qe\">시간의 길이는 Stunde, 시각은 Uhr예요. 둘 이상이면 복수 Stunden이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> 연도 1975는?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) neunzehnhundertfünfundsiebzig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) neunzehnhundertsiebenundfünfzig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) neunzehnfünfundsiebzig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) eintausendneunhundertfünfundsiebzig</button></div><div class=\"qe\">1100–1999년은 백 단위로 읽어요 — neunzehn + hundert + fünfundsiebzig.<br>hundert를 빼면 안 돼요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;vierten&quot;],[&quot;zwanzigsten&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Die Ausstellung ist vom <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(4.)</span> bis zum <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(20.)</span> März.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 전시회는 3월 4일부터 20일까지예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Ausstellung ist vom <b>vierten</b> bis zum <b>zwanzigsten</b> März.</div>vom·zum 뒤의 서수는 -en이에요.<br>4.은 vier + te, 20.부터는 -ste라서 zwanzigsten이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> 공식 시각 20:35는?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) zwanzig Uhr fünfunddreißig</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) zwanzig fünfunddreißig Uhr</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) fünf nach halb neun Uhr</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) fünfunddreißig nach zwanzig</button></div><div class=\"qe\">공식 시각은 시 + Uhr + 분 순서예요.<br>일상 시각 fünf nach halb neun에는 Uhr를 붙이지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;fünf&quot;],[&quot;acht&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Es ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> vor halb <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">7시 25분이에요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Es ist <b>fünf</b> vor halb <b>acht</b>.</div>25분은 halb를 기준으로 말해요. 7:30이 halb acht이고, 그 5분 전이라서 fünf vor halb acht예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ab Montag arbeitet Sara von acht bis vier.&quot;,&quot;Sara arbeitet ab Montag von acht bis vier.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">월요일부터 사라는 8시부터 4시까지 일해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Sara</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">bis</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">vier.</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Montag</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">acht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">von</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">arbeitet</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Ab</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ab Montag arbeitet Sara von acht bis vier.</b></div>앞으로 시작하는 때는 ab, 기간은 von … bis로 말해요.<br>Ab Montag가 첫 자리면 동사 뒤에 주어가 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Die Prüfung ist <span class=\"qblank\"></span> einer Woche. (지금부터 일주일 뒤에)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) vor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) in</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) seit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) nach</button></div><div class=\"qe\">지금부터 ~ 뒤는 in이에요.<br>nach는 '어떤 일 다음에'(nach dem Unterricht)를 말할 때 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gießt&quot;],[&quot;Zweimal&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Wie oft <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(gießen)</span> du die Blumen? — <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(2-mal)</span> in der Woche.</div><div class=\"qko\">꽃에 얼마나 자주 물을 줘? — 일주일에 두 번.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wie oft <b>gießt</b> du die Blumen? — <b>Zweimal</b> in der Woche.</div>어간이 -ß로 끝나서 du에 -t만 붙여요 — du gießt.<br>횟수는 수 + mal을 한 단어로 써요 — zweimal.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;achtzehn&quot;],[&quot;fünf&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> Heute sind es <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(18)</span> Komma <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(5)</span> Grad.</div><div class=\"qko\">오늘은 18.5도예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Heute sind es <b>achtzehn</b> Komma <b>fünf</b> Grad.</div>독일어는 소수점에 쉼표를 써요. 18,5는 achtzehn Komma fünf로 읽어요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Um Mitternacht ist der Park leer.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) In der Nacht arbeitet Herr Yilmaz.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Der Yogakurs beginnt am elften März.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Wir fliegen in 2027 nach Kanada.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">연도 앞에는 in을 쓰지 않아요 — Wir fliegen 2027 nach Kanada.<br>날짜는 am + 서수 -en, 밤은 in der Nacht, 자정은 um Mitternacht예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;am&quot;],[&quot;ersten&quot;],[&quot;um&quot;],[&quot;Im&quot;],[&quot;zweihundertfünfzig&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Der Tanzkurs beginnt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(1.)</span> September <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"> 18 Uhr.<br><input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"> Oktober ist eine Woche Pause.<br>Er kostet <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:20ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 5\"><span class=\"qh\">(250)</span> Euro.</div><div class=\"qko\">댄스 수업은 9월 1일 18시에 시작해요. 10월에는 일주일 쉬어요. 수업료는 250유로예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Tanzkurs beginnt <b>am</b> <b>ersten</b> September <b>um</b> 18 Uhr.<br><b>Im</b> Oktober ist eine Woche Pause.<br>Er kostet <b>zweihundertfünfzig</b> Euro.</div>날짜는 am + 서수 -en(am ersten), 시각은 um, 달은 im이에요.<br>250은 zwei + hundert + fünfzig를 한 단어로 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> Die Oper beginnt um halb acht (abends) und dauert drei Stunden. Wann ist sie zu Ende?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Um zehn Uhr halb.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Um elf Uhr dreißig.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Um halb elf.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Um halb zehn.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">halb acht는 7시 30분이에요. 세 시간 뒤는 10시 30분, 곧 halb elf예요.<br>공식 시각이라면 zweiundzwanzig Uhr dreißig예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;tausendzweihundert&quot;,&quot;eintausendzweihundert&quot;],[&quot;zwölfhundert&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> 1.200 Gäste → <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:23ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(수량)</span> Gäste · im Jahr 1200 → im Jahr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:14ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(연도)</span></div><div class=\"qko\">손님 1,200명 · 1200년에</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · 1.200 Gäste → <b>tausendzweihundert</b> Gäste · im Jahr 1200 → im Jahr <b>zwölfhundert</b></div>수량은 천 단위로 (ein)tausendzweihundert, 1100–1999년은 백 단위로 zwölfhundert라고 읽어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Am Sonntag gibt es um elf Uhr ein Konzert.&quot;,&quot;Am Sonntag um elf Uhr gibt es ein Konzert.&quot;,&quot;Um elf Uhr gibt es am Sonntag ein Konzert.&quot;,&quot;Es gibt am Sonntag um elf Uhr ein Konzert.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">일요일 11시에 콘서트가 있어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">gibt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Sonntag</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">um</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">elf</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">ein</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Konzert.</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">es</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Uhr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">Am</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Am Sonntag gibt es um elf Uhr ein Konzert.</b></div>es gibt 뒤의 ein Konzert는 4격이에요. 시간 표현이 첫 자리에 오면 동사 gibt 뒤에 es가 와요.<br>요일은 am, 시각은 um이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> Heute ist der 31. Juli. → Wir haben heute <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Juli.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) der einunddreißigste</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) dem einunddreißigsten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) den einunddreißigten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) den einunddreißigsten</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Wir haben … 뒤는 4격이라서 den + 서수 -en이에요.<br>20 이상은 -ste라서 einunddreißigsten이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"